      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛后，无声铃鹿表示体会到了大树快车\n热血的跑法，并掌握到自己所缺乏的事物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1801cebc306929f36dc68c5abacd1464f4ab6b8e1ffbf31e537b5a7bdabcc9ee",
