    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e076072668e56042b772fd9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相较于要前往香港的她，\n继续追求速度的大树快车\n将下个目标定在“安田纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97b8e46d2db0aa9e3cb2aa52d3e839a505cb3991c4bef01ea693fafa0af20f8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010421.json",
      "json_path": [
