    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eca5cde0455f3e1b6c820e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“英里冠军赛”落幕了。\n接下来只能等待结果公布。\n究竟她能不能达成目标呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "861eef7b75e3f6a1d5f1a2325933c524ba3625412f8f478ffe31ec5034a2d923",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
