    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76b46a1c05213f1254f05380",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英里CS结束后・成为年度代表？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81dc3bc8679d635216e8a6f1fc77ebe9a343c75de65d3e35ceba7274099edb41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d2eb856eb6ba06214ffd6ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车以她与生俱来的力量，\n克服了赛道的差劲路况！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5d41b79b5b9cf24b0608a59260124a1b1d321da887748d29c7e3cb593724f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3920faaa8428d7aafb601b5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她强而有力的表现让观众们看得兴奋不已，\n使大树快车也沉浸在喜悦的气氛中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cb7a484bb579ccd66882f8dfd6d260f3cce4ebe4274441dfaa641b141e3b39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e82310cffadf998a508f125",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她下一个目标，\n是比英里级还要短的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a37c7fc2c998aa72569692a260399783a1bc0584600423c7dc839a3447e69656",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f0cd75a952f23a3df4ba364",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让她的“速度”深深烙印在观众心里，\n她决定要参加“短途马锦标”了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7abfc8a0bc27922b784942da9818abcfe15d0cd98111b8b59885ad7888639af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a005db318328bf8787b956",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "安田纪念结束后・“力量”与──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7544a86443ea9128353cee813cb3d7d7e7f16706170b57f7f1ef26f05383bfb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be6c41a822bf748c51bae95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车上演了一场令人屏息的电击战，\n最后称霸了“短途马锦标”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e28521ef77e82d5306bb10c07ec2dff32f1f5e0eef95f1940f5c749a0292a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c8574ee1eb2d56a4317f1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车她精彩的比赛表现，\n令许多观众为之陶醉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abdb8fb0239c4a9a05c1ee7b49e856b73af394f969464d6f38725c0f5131aaf1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f9bdce84e0af74f19963d62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的双脚还未因此停下，\n接着要迈向……秋季英里王决定赛──\n“英里冠军赛”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4cea0be46ab6d3f687eb5846131a7ddd7a9abb961967eaf900ea04cc1b4fd29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:992744a6e01d6de1b1428d85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她将挑战称霸春秋英里GⅠ，\n以及秋季短距离GⅠ这两项壮举！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ca5ae8fa7417ae3088e4924139a4d92b23fd7f164a2477c2032be20fd59d3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e2273d5821ec099e49fa82d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "短途马S结束后・“速度”",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c4b31b5eb5bf6fc9f7e420e15db0fdb890fcd231f9ab55d0121dbba07a6fcc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:379b66b474c712e5884d58b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夺下精彩胜利的大树快车，\n令观众为她献上震耳欲聋的欢呼与喝彩……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa046601d12fe8645acd25d806aa397f63f6d547d1a7be7ede8195f0daf0d50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06cd8ebe83e36db7fdb9d8cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "压制现任最强的赛马娘无声铃鹿，\n称霸三项短距离GⅠ竞赛，\n大树快车让众人见识到了她的巨星气质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc4a378ae3ea305f8e5ccc7596d5401fe04de7fc22b2d1aa3dfd16364d7482a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1773b9d67b1901c4fabb2077",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经铆足全力的她，剩下的目标是……\n“成为年度代表赛马娘！”\n──仅仅如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b74e0a58d4bbc8a5144105f1fb1f7aeb7606aab77d20ac7bc7ae1a08c3db6492",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f597674c38d7ba490f6e682",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英里CS结束后・Trust Me！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acc165f15656e4e830c33cef346035a4e1ae4270f6449d390c78e7bea6a1762",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f1cd4ab9faf7ce3545791f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大树快车在电视机前，\n观看无声铃鹿从香港回来后与待兼福来\n一同参加的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "478d321a6108d4f846992ab434635f260fb542859f44cc5a23dea2677f42c3b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:664c8d8b4f93be4d6518aa00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那场比赛获胜的无声铃鹿，\n和第二名拉开了10马身以上的差距，\n非常令人“印象深刻”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7664ab6c098e1ee7e3b416b27ac08ec399b946acf222590bf62328fcbb318461",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de506667bde2216371b5fbb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "见到朋友的胜利，\n大树快车发出由衷的欢呼，\n并开始举行庆祝胜利的派对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d39c58a073ceee696b46b87718addd07c9a565a36c1eaf379be0f6be229c28f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1010/storytimeline_501010425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
